bb\":568337,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/12/5/devanagari/\",\"body_final\":\"क्ल‍ेशोऽधिकतरस्तेषामव्यक्तासक्तचेतसाम् ।
अव्यक्ता हि गतिर्दु:खं देहवद्भ‍िरवाप्यते ॥ ५ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":3505,\"bb\":3088,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/12/5/b3088/\",\"body_value\":\"kleśo ’dhika-taras teṣām
avyaktāsakta-cetasām
