dehavadbhir avāpyate\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":3506,\"bb\":3089,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/12/5/b3089/\",\"shadow_value\":\"kleśaḥ – trouble; adhika-taraḥ – very much; teṣām – of them; avyakta – to the unmanifested; āsakta – attached; cetasām – of those whose minds; avyaktā – toward the unmanifested; hi – certainly; gatiḥ – progress; duḥkham – with trouble; deha-vadbhiḥ – by the embodied; avāpyate – is achieved.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"kleśaḥ\",\"translation\":\"trouble\"},{\"word\":\"adhika-taraḥ\",\"translation\":\"very much\"},{\"word\":\"teṣām\",\"translation\":\"of them\"},{\"word\":\"avyakta\",\"translation\":\"to the unmanifested\"},{\"word\":\"āsakta\",\"translation\":\"attached\"},{\"word\":\"cetasām\",\"translation\":\"of those whose minds\"},{\"word\":\"avyaktā\",\"translation\":\"toward the unmanifested\"},{\"word\":\"hi\",\"translation\":\"certainly\"},{\"word\":\"gatiḥ\",\"translation\":\"progress\"},{\"word\":\"duḥkham\",\"translation\":\"with trouble\"},{\"word\":\"deha-vadbhiḥ\",\"translation\":\"by the embodied\"},{\"word\":\"avāpyate\",\"translation\":\"is achieved\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":3507,\"bb\":3090,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/12/5/b3090/\",\"body_value\":\"For those whose minds are attached to the unmanifested, impersonal feature of the Supreme, advancement is very troublesome. To make progress in that discipline is always difficult for those who are embodied.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":3508,\"bb\":3091,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/12/5/b3091/\",\"body_value\":\"$25\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":3509,\"bb\":3092,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/12/5/b3092/\",\"body_value\":\" A crude example may be given here. We may find some mailboxes on the street, and if we post our letters in those boxes, they will naturally go to their destination without difficulty. But any old box, or an imitation which we may find somewhere but which is not authorized by the post office, will not do the work. Similarly, God has an authorized representation in the Deity form, which is called arcā-vigraha. This arcā-vigraha is an incarnation of the Supreme Lord. God will accept service through that form. The Lord is omnipotent, all-powerful; therefore, by His incarnation as arcā-vigraha He can accept the services of the devotee, just to make it convenient for the man in conditioned life.\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":3510,\"bb\":3093,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/12/5/b3093/\",\"body_value\":\"$26\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":3511,\"bb\":3094,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/12/5/b3094/\",\"body_value\":\"$27\"}]}],\"short_title\":\"Bg. 12.5\",\"medium_title\":\"Bhagavad-gītā As It Is 12.5\"},\"locale\":\"en\",\"activeView\":\"$6:props:activeView\"}]}],\"$L28\",\"$L29\",\"$L2a\"]}]\n"])self.__next_f.push([1,"2c:I[83068,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n32:I[78455,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\